2026-11-01T21:29:25.4484543Z [31m+ ## 1. What is EIDOS v3.4.0 & Why It Exists[39m
2026-11-01T21:29:25.4484812Z [31m+[39m
2026-11-01T21:29:25.4485855Z [31m+ **EIDOS v3.4.0** is an open, self-hostable, sub-15ms **Hybrid Vector Search and Multi-Objective Recommendation Platform** with a built-in **Visual Merchandising & Explainable Ranking Studio**.[39m
2026-11-01T21:29:25.4486502Z [31m+[39m
2026-11-01T21:29:25.4487737Z [31m+ Traditional search engines (like Elasticsearch or Meilisearch) fail when users search by meaning or intent, while pure vector databases (like Pinecone or Qdrant) lack lexical precision, business merchandising rules, MMR diversification, and visual tooling for product managers. Enterprise SaaS platforms (like Algolia or Constructor.io) charge steep per-request and per-record fees while operating as opaque black boxes.[39m
2026-11-01T21:29:25.4488572Z [31m+[39m
2026-11-01T21:29:25.4488834Z [31m+ **EIDOS v3.4.0 solves all three problems in a single unified runtime:**[39m
2026-11-01T21:29:25.4490009Z [31m+ - **Production Core (Out-of-the-Box)**: `384-d HNSW + BM25+ + RRF` hybrid retrieval, 7-component Explainable X-Ray + human-readable ranking summary, JSON/CSV catalog upsert with row-level validation ([`docs/CSV_CONTRACT.md`](./docs/CSV_CONTRACT.md)), Clean Start (`0 SKU`) + Isolated Demo Sandbox (`48 SKU`), and role-based API keys + atomic snapshots ([`docs/PRODUCTION.md`](./docs/PRODUCTION.md)).[39m
2026-11-01T21:29:25.4491262Z [31m+ - **Experimental / Lab Modules**: Kinetic Attention micro-biometrics, Gram-Schmidt Serendipity Ray, Chrono-Cognitive session tempo, and 3D Pareto Weight Optimizer (available in Studio Expert / Lab mode).[39m
2026-11-01T21:29:25.4492419Z [31m+ - **True Hybrid Retrieval (`HNSW + BM25+ + RRF`)**: Combines 384-dimensional L2-normalized semantic vectors (`HNSWGraph` with optional `INT8` scalar quantization for 4× RAM savings) with exact lexical `BM25+` matching and Reciprocal Rank Fusion.[39m
2026-11-01T21:29:25.4493074Z [31m+ - **3 Next-Gen Cognitive Ranking Vectors + 2D Intent Synthesizer Radar**:[39m
2026-11-01T21:29:25.4494111Z [31m+   1. **Vector 1 — Sub-Second Micro-Biometrics (`KineticAttentionEngine`)**: Analyzes live scroll velocity (`px/s`), card hover dwell time (`ms`), A↔B comparison alternations, and price-tag hover frequency into a 16-d kinetic vector—automatically classifying the user as a `sniper`, `comparer`, `price_hesitant`, or `scanner`.[39m
2026-11-01T21:29:25.4495732Z [31m+   2. **Vector 2 — Anti-Echo-Chamber Serendipity (`SerendipityOrthogonalEngine`)**: Computes the centroid $\vec{u}$ of the top-3 dominant hits and uses **Gram-Schmidt Orthogonalization** ($\vec{v}_\perp = \vec{q} - \text{proj}_{\vec{u}}(\vec{q})$) to inject unexpected yet relevant cross-category discoveries (`✦ Serendipity Ray`).[39m
2026-11-01T21:29:25.4497034Z [31m+   3. **Vector 3 — Circadian & Session Fatigue Tempo (`ChronoCognitiveEngine`)**: Adapts semantic $\alpha$ and exploration temperature $T$ across 4 biological time windows (`morning_precision`, `afternoon_analytical`, `evening_leisure`, `dopamine_discovery` at 22:00–05:59).[39m
2026-11-01T21:29:25.4498716Z [31m+ - **Intent-Aware Search & 7-Component Explainable X-Ray**: Automatically extracts `category`, `useCase`, and `priceRange` (`min`/`max`) from natural-language queries (e.g., *"недорогие наушники для бега"* / *"budget running headphones under $150"*) and exposes a 7-component mathematical breakdown (`denseComponent`, `sparseBm25Component`, `rrfScore`, `mmrPenalty`, `businessBoost`, `kineticBonus`, `serendipityScore`).[39m
2026-11-01T21:29:25.4500221Z [31m+ - **Adaptive Query Router & Pareto Multi-Objective Optimizer**: Dynamically selects `efSearch` (`24` / `64` / `128 + Cross-Encoder`) based on query entropy and computes the non-dominated 3D Pareto frontier (`Relevance × Diversity × Margin`) with automatic knee-point selection (`/v1/optimize/pareto`).[39m
2026-11-01T21:29:25.4501955Z [31m+ - **Clean Start Architecture (`0 SKU`) & Isolated Demo Sandbox**: Main product boots 100% clean (`initialItemsIndexed = 0`, `initializedEmpty: true` verified in `/v1/health`) so teams can immediately upload their own JSON/CSV catalog or connect PostgreSQL/MongoDB/1C-Bitrix, while a dedicated one-click **Isolated Demo Sandbox (`POST /v1/demo/load` / `POST /v1/demo/reset`)** loads a 48-SKU (scalable to 1,200-SKU) multi-domain showcase without polluting production state.[39m
2026-11-01T21:29:25.4503464Z [31m+ - **Zero External API Bills & O(1) LRU Embedding Cache**: Generates deterministic, cross-lingual 384-dimensional embeddings (`EN / RU / JA / ZH`) natively on CPU (`<0.05ms` with bounded 512-entry LRU cache) or via browser WebGPU/WASM (`Xenova/multilingual-e5-small`).[39m
