2026-11-01T21:29:25.4744776Z [31m+ - **Q: Does EIDOS require a GPU or an OpenAI API key?**[39m
2026-11-01T21:29:25.4746045Z [31m+   **A:** No. EIDOS runs 100% self-contained on standard CPUs with sub-5ms latency using deterministic 384-d n-gram/word-hash L2 embeddings on the server and optional WebGPU/WASM `multilingual-e5-small` in the browser.[39m
