2026-11-01T21:29:25.4748250Z [31m+   **A:** Set `EIDOS_SNAPSHOT_PATH=/data/catalog.snapshot.json` and mount a Docker volume at `/data`. Every `/v1/catalog/upsert` automatically schedules a non-blocking atomic snapshot write.[39m
