2026-11-01T21:29:25.4750318Z [31m+   **A:** Use `alpha = 0.65` for general e-commerce (65% semantic meaning + 35% exact keyword/SKU match). Use `diversity_factor = 0.30 - 0.45` on homepages and discovery feeds to prevent duplicate variants from crowding the top results.[39m
